  "method": "For each of the 47 split days in ascending order, the harness calls holdings_performance._frame_for for the 49 Financial entry twice on one shared PartitionCache: the BEFORE arm with the split_adjust key removed from an in-memory copy of sources.json, and the AFTER arm with the declaration as written. Per day it counts accounts whose daily_return differs by more than 1e-12 or whose status differs, the accounts with a t-1 row on a split security (identifier chain, producer identifier(), split securities from _split_ratios_for_day), the adjusted and ratio-absent securities from the AFTER attributes, and the rows at or below -0.5 in each arm; totals are the sums over computable days. Reads only; no write call.",
